# Keep the public GitHub repository limited to cleaned analysis material.

# Ignore everything by default, then re-include the Codex analysis tree.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CHATGPT_CONTEXT.md
!PUBLIC_DATA_POLICY.md
!platform-tools/
platform-tools/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/**

# Original game binaries.
*.apk
*.obb
*.pak
*.dex
*.xapk
*.ucas
*.utoc
*.so
*.dll
*.exe
*.mp4
*.gbf
*.ps

# Phone backups, private data, and original extracted game content.
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Android-data/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Phone-storage/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Backups/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/APK/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/MAIN/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/PATCH/

# Raw logs and temporary analysis output.
*.log
*.pid
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/*.txt
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/ghidra_export_functions.json

# Local Ghidra and compilation artifacts.
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/ghidra_project/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/**/javac_probe/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase7/local_only_recovered/
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.lock
*.class

# Backup archives and bulk exports.
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/**/*.tar
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/**/*.tar.gz
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/**/*.zip

# Secrets and credentials must never be published.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.keystore
*token*
*cookie*
